OL,3,GNEWSAHot summer takes toll on chalk
OL,4,Astream ecosystems
OL,5,
OL,6,FA summer of consistently low rainfall
OL,7,Fand high temperatures has damaged the
OL,8,Ffragile ecosystems of chalk streams,
OL,9,Fconservationists have warned.
OL,11,FOn the River Pang in Berkshire,
OL,12,Fstretches of the waterway have dried up
OL,13,Fin places where residents and anglers
OL,14,Fsay they have never previously seen.
OL,16,FThe chalk stream was also rated as poor
OL,17,Fby the Environment Agency this summer
OL,18,Fafter failing a test for hazardous
OL,19,Fsubstances.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
