OL,3,GNEWSAHot summer takes toll on chalk
OL,4,Astream ecosystems
OL,5,
OL,6,FChalk streams are a globally rare
OL,7,Fhabitat, with about 85% of the world's
OL,8,Fexamples found in the UK, and they
OL,9,Fsupport species including water voles,
OL,10,Fwhite-clawed crayfish, brown trout and
OL,11,Fkingfishers.
